    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A Treant who used to live south of Gludio, he loved trees and nature. After the war with Beleth, his beautiful forest home was destroyed, and his friends were slain. Deeply affected by that traumatic loss he is now trapped in a haze of hatred, madness, and the desire for revenge. Gripped by his anger, he is still at war against all humans and mystics. Spirits Lv. 7 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Spirits. P. Def. +5% Evasion +5 Resistance to Derangement +20% Resistance to Sleep +20% M. Def. -5% Accuracy -5 Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
